      "summary": "With exactly one year before his mandate expires on 13 May 2027, multiple French media ran long-form assessments of Macron's record. Le JDD described 'a week where everything unravels,' Le Figaro warned of 'a final high-risk year,' and former ministers from his own camp publicly criticised his governance style. Macron himself maintained ambiguity about his post-2027 plans."
    },
